comments[2]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-09-07T21:14:01.876Z",codex-pm-ecosystem,"2026-09-07 UTC: wall-clock sampling falsely reported 13.98x growth under concurrent fleet load. CPU sampling keeps the existing 8x bound for quadrupled input, calibrates after warm-up, and removes time spent descheduled. The full 203-test gate passes. A deliberate temporary restoration of the original quadratic HEADER_RE failed the CPU-growth assertion as required, and the exact original source bytes were restored afterward."
  "2026-09-07T21:14:02.965Z",codex-pm-ecosystem,"Final local release:check passed using installed CLI/SDK 2026.9.7 and pm-changelog 2026.9.6. Final top-level test report: tests=1, pass=1, fail=0, skipped=0. ℹ all files |  69.31 |    87.09 |   76.07 | . Coverage is the current reported scope; complete four-dimensional source certification and independent production/privacy/review gates remain open."
